## getName (let)
λ(r: Row) =>
  λ(obj: Σ($sig: [ name: Irrelevant ]) . Schema [ name: String | r ]) ->
    (obj).name

## person (let)
νstrict [] . Struct [ name: "Alice", age: 30 ]

## book (let)
νstrict [] . Struct [ name: "1984", author: "Orwell", pages: 328 ]

## n1 (let)
getName @[ age: Num ] person

## n2 (let)
getName @[ author: String, pages: Num ] book
